# Generated files.
#
# The vault mirror of 2repo's wiki/architecture output is meant to be committed
# (regenerating it costs real LLM tokens/time), so every regen touches most of
# each file and would otherwise show up as a wall of changed prose in reviews.
# linguist-generated collapses these in GitHub diffs. Deliberately NOT '-diff'
# or 'diff=off' — that would suppress the textual diff locally too, and local
# `git diff` is exactly where you want to see what a regen actually changed.
vault/Projects/*/Generated/** linguist-generated=true
